                <p>Source: Johnson Library, National Security File, Memos to the President, McGeorge
                    Bundy, Vol. XI. Secret. Bundy sent this annotated agenda to the President at
                    4:15 p.m., under cover of a brief memorandum describing it.</p>
            </note>
